OL,3,GNEWSATrial set for man accused of
OL,4,A51-year-old's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial date has been set for a man
OL,7,Faccused of murdering a man in Peterlee.
OL,9,FKenneth Fishwick, 53, did not enter any
OL,10,Fpleas when he appeared at Teesside
OL,11,FCrown Court on Tuesday.
OL,13,FHe is accused of murdering 51-year-old
OL,14,FDean Fishwick, who died in hospital
OL,15,Fafter being found injured at a property
OL,16,Fon Thames Road on 23 September.
OL,18,FA trial was set for 12 April 2027, with
OL,19,FKenneth Fishwick remanded in custody
OL,20,Fahead of a plea hearing on 26 October.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
